Package: mipR
Title: Spatiotemporal Measles Population Immunity Profiling
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Mohamed A.", "Yusuf", , "moyusuf@who.int", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9339-4613"))
Description: Provides a framework for reconstructing and projecting
    measles population immunity across birth cohorts, age groups,
    geographical units, and calendar months. The package is designed to
    integrate routine immunisation coverage, supplementary immunisation
    activities, and vaccine effectiveness assumptions to support
    spatiotemporal immunity profiling. Planned capabilities include
    subnational immunity estimation, uncertainty analysis, and evaluation
    of alternative vaccination scenarios.
